//fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-donor-patient</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td>identifier, _id</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href="#Observation1-2">Observation</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-nmdp-hla-genotype.html">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-hla-genotype</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td>subject, code</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href="#ServiceRequest1-3">ServiceRequest</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-nmdp-donor-order.html">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-donor-order</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td>subject, identifier</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href="#Organization1-4">Organization</a></td><td><a href="StructureDefinition-nmdp-organization.html">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-organization</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"/><td class="text-center"/><td>identifier, name</td><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="Patient1-1" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Patient</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-nmdp-donor-patient.html">NMDP Donor Patient</a></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Suppor