</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_id</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="col-lg-5"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 id="Observation1-2" class="panel-title"><span style="float: right;">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Observation</h4></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-nmdp-hla-genotype.html">NMDP HLA Genotype Observation</a></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class="col-lg-3"><span class="lead">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="lead">Search Parameters</span><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>subject</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Search HLA observations by donor Patient reference</p>
